    <version>1.07.5</version>
    <time>1775743890</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Update to 1.07.5
  * For details on bug fixes and added features see the CHANGELOG,
    https://github.com/IUPAC-InChI/InChI/blob/v1.07.5/INCHI-1-DOC/CHANGELOG.md
- Drop inchi-1.06-optflags.patch:  no longer needed
- Drop inchi-1.06-big-endian.patch:  fails to apply, needs rewrite
- Add inchi-1.07-no-fetchcontent.patch:  inhibit dynamic downloads
- .spec file:
  * switch to cmake, as upstream uses it to build
  * small tweaks to cmakefiles to fix build problems
- Add inchi-1.06-big-endian.patch: Fix build on big-endian
  architectures (rh#1930943).
- Add Conflicts with openbabel-devel &lt;= 2.4.1: openbabel-devel
  used to ship the headers of its bundled inchi.
- Initial package: inchi-1.06.
</comment>
    <requestid>1345499</requestid>
  </revision>
